<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-SFE January wheat falls 50c to A$163/tonne.</title>
<headline>RTRS-SFE January wheat falls 50c to A$163/tonne.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Light trading left nearby January wheat futures slightly down at the Sydney Futures Exchange on Monday.</p>
<p>The January contract fell 50 cents to A$163.00 a tonne, with one lot traded.</p>
<p>No other contracts were traded.</p>
<p>A seasonal slowdown in trading activity coupled with expectations of a record or near-record Australian wheat crop approaching 22 million tonnes this year has sidelined market participants, traders said.  </p>
